Chapter: ManifestSubject

 A subject whose only purpose is to carry a KNOWN capability manifest, for
 the manifest-scope pin (BACKLOG 1.5). It declares two scoped capabilities
 and nothing else, so its emitted manifest is a fixed, checkable shape.
 Compiled fresh by the current compiler and attached as the reader's disk,
 it turns a manifest-cap-bytes regression into a failing test rather than a
 thing only inspection catches.

Section: Body

  opening : [Network.Write "api.example.com", FileSystem.Read "/config/"] Integer = 0
